+# Laden Update
+
+The update notifier and applier of **Laden OS** (tray applet, desktop
+notifications, guided `pacman`/AUR/Flatpak updates, news, pacnew, orphan and
+cache handling).
+
+**Based on** [Cachy-Update](https://github.com/CachyOS/cachy-update) by CachyOS,
+which is itself a fork of [Arch-Update](https://github.com/Antiz96/arch-update)
+by Robin Candau (Antiz96) and contributors. All credit for the program goes to
+them; Laden OS only changes the name, icons, desktop entries and notification
+text. The command stays `arch-update` (with a `laden-update` alias) and the
+config file stays `~/.config/arch-update/arch-update.conf`, so documentation
+and configs from upstream keep working.
+
+License: GPL-3.0-or-later (see `LICENSE`, unchanged from upstream).
+Original upstream README: [README.upstream.md](README.upstream.md).
